<div class="t-content wysiwyg__content" >
	<p><strong>On the go? Skip the line by ordering ahead!</strong></p>
<p><a class="c-btn" href="https://get.cbord.com/carletonstolaf/full/prelogin.php">ORDER NOW</a></p>
<p>1. Order on your mobile device.<br />
2. Choose your pick-up time.<br />
3. Pay using your dining funds.<br />
4. Pick-up at Sayles Café!</p>
<p><strong>Username: </strong>enter your Carleton email address without the @ extension</p>
<p><strong>Password:</strong> use the same as what you log into your email with</p>

